# Streamlining IT Procurement - ServiceNow

## Project Overview
This project automates the IT Laptop procurement process using ServiceNow Flow Designer.

## Phase 1: Flow Creation
- Created a Flow named "Standard laptop task" in Flow Designer
- Trigger: Service Catalog
- Action: Create Catalog Task for Hardware group
- File: [Phase-1.md](Phase-1.md)

## Phase 2: Flow Assignment
- Assigned the Flow to "Standard Laptop" Catalog Item in Maintain Items
- File: [Phase-2.md](Phase-2.md)

## Phase 3: Testing
- Ordered Standard Laptop from Service Catalog
- Approved the request and verified task creation for Hardware team
- File: [Phase-3.md](Phase-3.md)

## Screenshots
All implementation screenshots are uploaded (page1.png to page14.png)

## Result
Manual IT procurement process is now automated. Task automatically reaches Hardware team without manual intervention.


